The {{Term/Store|Of Time Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Hero of Time Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="Cac 192"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Hero of Time Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Cap of Time]], [[Tunic of Time]], and [[Trousers of Time]]. All three pieces can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{OoT|-}} Link Amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain one of the pieces. As the Amiibo can only be scanned once per real-world day, a player must collect the set over three or more real-world days. 

The set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set. It resembles Link's outfit from {{OoT}}.

